---
layout: page
title: Blog Stats
description: 'All blog statistics can be found here.'
permalink: '/blog/stats.html'
---

<style>
    .graph {
        margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .graph__wrapper {
        position: relative;
        height: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .graph__progress {
        background: var(--color-primary);
        height: 100%;
        margin-left: 10px;
    }
    
    .graph__year {
        font-family: var(--monospace);
    }

    .graph__data {
        margin-left: 10px;
    }
</style>

<span class="post-stats">
    {% set latestPost = collections.posts | reverse %}
    <p>My most recent blogpost, <a href="{{ latestPost[0].url | url }}"">"{{ latestPost[0].data.title }}"</a>, was published on <strong>{{ collections.postStats.lastPostDate | formatDate('MMMM D, YYYY') }}</strong>. My earliest post, <a href="{{ collections.posts[0].url | url  }}"">"{{ collections.posts[0].data.title }}"</a>, was published on <strong>{{ collections.postStats.firstPostDate | formatDate('MMMM D, YYYY') }}</strong>.<p>
    <br></br>
    <p>I do repost work from other sites on occasion and maintain their original date, including the aforementioned earliest post. The first post <em>designated for this site</em> was <a href="/blog/next-mission-entering-a-game-jam">"Next mission: entering a game jam"</a> on <strong>February 20, 2025<strong>. </p>
    <br>
    <p>I've published <strong>{{ collections.postStats.postCount }} posts in total</strong> that <strong>average {{ collections.postStats.avgWordCount | round }} words each</strong> and a typical gap of <strong>{{ collections.postStats.avgDays | round }} days</strong> between them.</p>
</span>

<h3>Posts by Year</h3>

<div class="graph">
    {% set highPostCount = 0 %}
    {%- for year in collections.postStats.years | reverse %}
        {%- for year in collections.postStats.years | reverse -%}
            {% if year.postCount >= highPostCount %} 
                {% set highPostCount = year.postCount %}
                {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}  
    <div class="graph__wrapper">
        <div class="graph__year">{{ year.year }}</div>
        <div class="graph__progress" style="width: {{ year.postCount / (highPostCount) * 100 }}%;">
        </div>
        <div class="graph__data">
            {{ year.postCount }}
        </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>

{% postGraph collections.posts %}